Built this against Telegram's own Mini App conventions (BackButton/MainButton own navigation and the primary action, not page-drawn controls), with a plain-DOM fallback so the component still works outside Telegram (e.g. in a browser preview). Five files, no files were created/edited — just pasting the code below.

